sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant P as Player
    participant C as Companion
    participant W as Website
    participant API as Pairing workflow
    C->>API: Begin short-lived pairing request
    API-->>C: Request reference for website confirmation
    C-->>P: Show pairing request
    P->>W: Sign in and confirm this companion
    W->>API: Authorize pairing for current Discord user
    alt Expired or rejected request
        API-->>C: Pairing denied - begin again
    else Authorized request
        API-->>C: Issue revocable upload authorization
        C->>C: Store authorization outside addon files
        P->>C: Choose installations and account folders
        C->>API: Upload only snapshots from selected folders
    end
    P->>W: Revoke this companion
    W->>API: Revoke pairing
    C->>API: Attempt next upload
    API-->>C: Authorization revoked - require pairing again
